section.para:
For the past year and half, our small Digital Humanities lab team has been investigating small language models and how we can work with them on projects involving XML technologies. We find small language models important to investigate in university and academic contexts for two primary objectives:
Education: To design explainable AI systems that help us to practically understand how language models process, retrieve, and generate text;
Economy: To design customized AI systems that can improve projects that require accurate data representation and quality control validation.
